::callout{tone="info"}
**For agents.** Read this page, then the child page you need. To edit a
wiki page, target blocks by ID (every id in this space starts with `nm-`),
run a proof first, and let a human approve. Do not rewrite whole pages.
::

## Out of scope {id="nm-home-non-goals"}

From `docs/direction.noma` and `CLAUDE.md`: a plugin marketplace, a complex
CSS theming engine, whiteboards and databases as feature-for-feature
clones, and anything that makes `.noma` source lossy or non-reviewable.
Every editor, importer, and agent path must round-trip through source with
stable IDs.
